# Figma Make reference exports - design source material, never built or deployed.
# The v2 folder is spelled with a hyphen; an earlier `figma_code_v2/` (underscore)
# typo here meant it was tracked by git while .dockerignore excluded it, which
# broke every Railway/Railpack build with
# `"/figma_code-v2/pnpm-lock.yaml": not found`.
figma_code/
figma_code-v2/
